{"speciesId":680,"names":{"fr":"Dimoclès","es":"Doublade","en":"Doublade","ja":"ニダンギル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"En évoluant, Monorpale se divise en deux épées qui communiquent par télépathie pour mieux découper leur adversaire en morceaux."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Al evolucionar se divide en dos espadas. Se comunican entre sí mediante telepatía y coordinan los ataques para rebanar al enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When Honedge evolves, it divides into two swords, which cooperate via telepathy to coordinate attacks and slash their enemies to ribbons."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"進化して ２本に 分裂した。 テレパシーで 会話して 連係攻撃で 敵を 切り刻む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Même les sabreurs chevronnés sont incapables de parer les assauts continus et complexes menés de concert par ces deux épées."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Ni siquiera el espadachín más ducho conseguiría esquivar los complejos ataques que encadenan ambas espadas a la vez."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The complex attack patterns of its two swords are unstoppable, even for an opponent greatly accomplished at swordplay."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"２本の 剣による 複雑な 連続攻撃を 防ぐことは 剣の 達人でも 不可能だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"En évoluant, Monorpale se divise en deux épées qui communiquent par télépathie pour mieux découper leur adversaire en morceaux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Al evolucionar se divide en dos espadas. Se comunican entre sí mediante telepatía y coordinan los ataques para rebanar al enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When Honedge evolves, it divides into two swords, which cooperate via telepathy to coordinate attacks and slash their enemies to ribbons."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"進化して ２本に 分裂した。 テレパシーで 会話して 連係攻撃で 敵を 切り刻む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Même les sabreurs chevronnés sont incapables de parer les assauts continus et complexes menés de concert par ces deux épées."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ni siquiera el espadachín más ducho conseguiría esquivar los complejos ataques que encadenan ambas espadas a la vez."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The complex attack patterns of its two swords are unstoppable, even for an opponent greatly accomplished at swordplay."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"２本の 剣による 複雑な 連続攻撃を 防ぐことは 剣の 達人でも 不可能だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il s’est dédoublé en évoluant. Il intimide ses ennemis à grands coups de bruits métalliques en entrechoquant ses deux lames."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su espada se duplicó durante su proceso de evolución. Intimida a los rivales con el chirrido metálico que produce al frotar ambas hojas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Honedge evolves into twins. The two blades rub together to emit a metallic sound that unnerves opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"進化して 双子に なった。 刃を 擦り合わせて 鳴らす 金属音で 相手を 威嚇。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses deux lames abattent leurs proies en enchaînant les attaques et les parades à un rythme effréné."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su táctica para abatir a las presas consiste en alternar ataque y defensa de forma frenética entre ambas espadas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The two swords employ a strategy of rapidly alternating between offense and defense to bring down their prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"２本の 剣は 攻撃と 防御が 目まぐるしく 入れ替わる 戦法で 獲物を しとめる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":680,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",50],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,